async function loadOverlay(){const taskId=$('#analyticsTaskSelect')?.value,seriesId=$('#overlaySeries')?.value;if(!taskId||!seriesId){renderOverlay(null);return}try{state.overlay=await api(`/api/tasks/${taskId}/series-overlay?series_id=${encodeURIComponent(seriesId)}&limit=40`);renderOverlay(state.overlay)}catch(e){toast(e.message,'ERROR')}}
$('#loadOverlay')?.addEventListener('click',loadOverlay);$('#overlaySeries')?.addEventListener('change',loadOverlay);
function renderOverlay(data){const svg=$('#overlayChart');if(!svg)return;const rows=data?.rows||[];const w=920,h=360,p=52;if(!rows.length){svg.setAttribute('viewBox',`0 0 ${w} ${h}`);svg.innerHTML='<text x="30" y="40">暂无可叠加曲线</text>';if($('#overlayInfo'))$('#overlayInfo').textContent='没有找到该曲线结果。';return}const allx=rows.flatMap(r=>r.x.map(Number)).filter(Number.isFinite),ally=rows.flatMap(r=>r.y.map(Number)).filter(Number.isFinite);let xmin=Math.min(...allx),xmax=Math.max(...allx),ymin=Math.min(...ally),ymax=Math.max(...ally);if(xmin===xmax){xmin-=.5;xmax+=.5}if(ymin===ymax){ymin-=.5;ymax+=.5}const px=x=>p+(x-xmin)/(xmax-xmin)*(w-2*p),py=y=>h-p-(y-ymin)/(ymax-ymin)*(h-2*p);let html=`<line x1="${p}" y1="${h-p}" x2="${w-p}" y2="${h-p}" stroke="#98a2b3"/><line x1="${p}" y1="${p}" x2="${p}" y2="${h-p}" stroke="#98a2b3"/>`;rows.forEach((r,i)=>{const pts=r.x.map((x,j)=>`${px(Number(x))},${py(Number(r.y[j]))}`).join(' ');const opacity=r.quality_status==='INVALID'?.15:(.22+(.65*(i===0)));html+=`<polyline fill="none" stroke="${r.quality_status==='INVALID'?'#f04438':r.quality_status==='WARNING'?'#f79009':'#175cd3'}" stroke-opacity="${opacity}" stroke-width="${i===0?2.4:1.2}" points="${pts}"><title>${esc(r.case_id)}</title></polyline>`});const first=rows[0];html+=`<text x="${w/2}" y="${h-10}" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" fill="#667085">${esc(first.x_label||'x')} ${esc(first.x_unit||'')}</text><text x="16" y="${h/2}" transform="rotate(-90 16 ${h/2})" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" fill="#667085">${esc(first.y_label||data.series_id)} ${esc(first.y_unit||'')}</text>`;svg.setAttribute('viewBox',`0 0 ${w} ${h}`);svg.innerHTML=html;if($('#overlayInfo'))$('#overlayInfo').textContent=`已叠加 ${rows.length} 个 Case；第一条曲线加粗，其余曲线降低透明度。`}
function renderPareto(){const o=state.optimization,svg=$('#paretoChart');if(!svg)return;const objectives=o?.objectives||[];$('#paretoCount').textContent=objectives.length?`${o.pareto_count||0} Pareto`:'未定义目标';if(objectives.length<2){svg.innerHTML='';$('#paretoInfo').textContent='该任务没有至少两个优化目标。';return}const xId=objectives[0].result_id,yId=objectives[1].result_id,rows=(o.rows||[]).filter(r=>Number.isFinite(Number(r[`result.${xId}`]))&&Number.isFinite(Number(r[`result.${yId}`])));const w=820,h=360,p=52;if(!rows.length){svg.innerHTML='<text x="30" y="40">暂无可用优化结果</text>';return}const xs=rows.map(r=>Number(r[`result.${xId}`])),ys=rows.map(r=>Number(r[`result.${yId}`]));let xmin=Math.min(...xs),xmax=Math.max(...xs),ymin=Math.min(...ys),ymax=Math.max(...ys);if(xmin===xmax){xmin-=.5;xmax+=.5}if(ymin===ymax){ymin-=.5;ymax+=.5}const px=x=>p+(x-xmin)/(xmax-xmin)*(w-2*p),py=y=>h-p-(y-ymin)/(ymax-ymin)*(h-2*p);svg.setAttribute('viewBox',`0 0 ${w} ${h}`);const color=r=>r.feasible===false?'#f04438':r.pareto_rank===0?'#12b76a':'#98a2b3';svg.innerHTML=`<line x1="${p}" y1="${h-p}" x2="${w-p}" y2="${h-p}" stroke="#98a2b3"/><line x1="${p}" y1="${p}" x2="${p}" y2="${h-p}" stroke="#98a2b3"/>`+rows.map(r=>`<circle cx="${px(Number(r[`result.${xId}`]))}" cy="${py(Number(r[`result.${yId}`]))}" r="${r.pareto_rank===0&&r.feasible!==false?7:4}" fill="${color(r)}"><title>${esc(r.case_id)} · generation ${esc(r.generation??0)} · feasible ${esc(r.feasible)} · rank ${esc(r.pareto_rank)}</title></circle>`).join('')+`<text x="${w/2}" y="${h-10}" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" fill="#667085">${esc(state.registry.outputs[xId]?.label||xId)}</text><text x="16" y="${h/2}" transform="rotate(-90 16 ${h/2})" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" fill="#667085">${esc(state.registry.outputs[yId]?.label||yId)}</text>`;$('#paretoInfo').textContent=`目标：${state.registry.outputs[xId]?.label||xId} (${objectives[0].direction}) / ${state.registry.outputs[yId]?.label||yId} (${objectives[1].direction})。绿色=可行非支配，灰色=可行支配，红色=违反约束；可行 ${o.feasible_count??'-'} / 不可行 ${o.infeasible_count??'-'}。`}
function renderParallelCoordinates(){const o=state.optimization,svg=$('#parallelChart');if(!svg)return;const dims=o?.parallel_dimensions||[],rows=(o?.parallel_rows||[]).slice(0,300);const w=820,h=360,p=55;if(dims.length<2||!rows.length){svg.innerHTML='<text x="30" y="40">暂无平行坐标数据</text>';return}const step=(w-2*p)/(dims.length-1),x=i=>p+i*step,y=v=>h-p-Number(v)*(h-2*p);let html='';dims.forEach((d,i)=>{const xx=x(i);html+=`<line x1="${xx}" y1="${p}" x2="${xx}" y2="${h-p}" stroke="#98a2b3"/><text x="${xx}" y="${h-p+18}" text-anchor="middle" font-size="9" fill="#667085">${esc(d.key.replace('param.','').replace('result.',''))}</text>`});rows.forEach(r=>{const pts=dims.map((d,i)=>r.coordinates[d.key]===undefined?null:`${x(i)},${y(r.coordinates[d.key])}`).filter(Boolean);if(pts.length<2)return;html+=`<polyline fill="none" stroke="${r.feasible===false?'#f04438':r.pareto_rank===0?'#12b76a':'#6172f3'}" stroke-opacity="${r.feasible===false?.14:r.pareto_rank===0?.9:.16}" stroke-width="${r.pareto_rank===0&&r.feasible!==false?2.3:1}" points="${pts.join(' ')}"><title>${esc(r.case_id)} · rank ${esc(r.pareto_rank)}</title></polyline>`});svg.setAttribute('viewBox',`0 0 ${w} ${h}`);svg.innerHTML=html}

async function loadDataFactory(){
  try{
    const [summary,datasets,tasks]=await Promise.all([api('/api/data-factory/summary'+projectQuery()),api('/api/datasets'+projectQuery()),api('/api/tasks'+projectQuery())]);
    state.dataFactory=summary;state.datasets=datasets;state.tasks=tasks;
    $('#factoryMetrics').innerHTML=[[uiText('已摄取任务','Ingested tasks'),summary.ingested_tasks],[uiText('标准化数据行','Curated rows'),summary.curated_case_rows],[uiText('数据集','Datasets'),summary.datasets],[uiText('版本数','Versions'),summary.dataset_versions],[uiText('版本化数据行','Versioned rows'),summary.dataset_rows]].map(([k,v])=>`<div class="metric-card"><span>${esc(k)}</span><b>${esc(v)}</b></div>`).join('');
    $('#factoryStatus').innerHTML=`<div class="definition-grid">${Object.entries(summary.zones||{}).map(([k,v])=>`<div class="definition-item"><span>${esc(k)}</span><b title="${esc(v)}">${esc(v)}</b></div>`).join('')}</div>`+(summary.recent_versions||[]).length?`<h3>${uiText('最近版本','Recent versions')}</h3>${(summary.recent_versions||[]).map(v=>`<div class="dataset-line"><span>${esc(v.id)}</span><b>${esc(v.row_count)} ${uiText('行','rows')}</b></div>`).join('')}`:`<p class="muted">${uiText('尚无数据集版本。','No dataset versions yet.')}</p>`;
    const taskOptions=(tasks||[]).filter(t=>(t.completed_cases||0)>0).map(t=>`<option value="${esc(t.id)}">${esc(t.name)} · ${esc(t.id)} · ${esc(t.solver_mode)}</option>`).join('');$('#factoryTasks').innerHTML=taskOptions;
    $('#factoryDatasetExisting').innerHTML=`<option value="">${uiText('新建数据集','Create new dataset')}</option>`+datasets.map(d=>`<option value="${esc(d.id)}">${esc(d.name)} · ${esc(d.id)}</option>`).join('');
    $('#datasetRegistry').innerHTML=datasets.length?datasets.map(d=>`<div class="dataset-card"><div><b>${esc(d.name)}</b><small>${esc(d.id)} · ${esc(d.description||'')}</small></div><div class="dataset-versions">${(d.versions||[]).map(v=>`<button type="button" data-dataset-version="${esc(d.id)}:${v.version}">v${String(v.version).padStart(4,'0')} · ${esc(v.row_count)} ${uiText('行','rows')}</button>`).join('')||`<span class="muted">${uiText('暂无版本','No versions')}</span>`}</div></div>`).join(''):`<p class="muted">${uiText('尚无数据集，请从已完成任务构建第一个不可变版本。','No datasets yet. Build the first immutable version from completed tasks.')}</p>`;
    $$('[data-dataset-version]').forEach(b=>b.addEventListener('click',()=>{const [id,v]=b.dataset.datasetVersion.split(':');openDatasetVersion(id,Number(v))}));
  }catch(e){toast(e.message,'ERROR');$('#factoryStatus').innerHTML=`<pre class="error-text">${esc(e.message)}</pre>`}
}
async function openDatasetVersion(datasetId,version){
  try{const d=await api(`/api/datasets/${datasetId}/versions/${version}`),m=d.manifest||{},q=m.quality_report||{};$('#datasetDetailPanel').classList.remove('hidden');$('#datasetDetail').innerHTML=`<div class="definition-grid">${[[uiText('版本','Version'),d.id],[uiText('行数','Rows'),d.row_count],[uiText('字段结构哈希','Schema hash'),d.schema_hash],[uiText('内容哈希','Content hash'),d.content_hash],[uiText('创建时间','Created'),d.created_at]].map(([k,v])=>`<div class="definition-item"><span>${esc(k)}</span><b>${esc(v??'-')}</b></div>`).join('')}</div><h3>${uiText('质量分布','Quality distribution')}</h3><div class="quality-badges">${Object.entries(q.quality_distribution||{}).map(([k,v])=>`<span class="status ${esc(k)}">${esc(k)} ${esc(v)}</span>`).join('')||`<span class="muted">${uiText('无数据','No rows')}</span>`}</div><h3>${uiText('稳定数据分区','Stable partitions')}</h3><div class="definition-grid">${Object.entries(q.partition_distribution||{}).map(([k,v])=>`<div class="definition-item"><span>${esc(k)}</span><b>${esc(v)}</b></div>`).join('')}</div><h3>${uiText('数据血缘','Lineage')}</h3><p class="muted">${esc(m.lineage_policy||'-')}</p><div class="actions"><a href="/api/datasets/${esc(datasetId)}/versions/${version}/download/csv"><button>CSV</button></a><a href="/api/datasets/${esc(datasetId)}/versions/${version}/download/jsonl"><button>JSONL</button></a>${m.files?.parquet?`<a href="/api/datasets/${esc(datasetId)}/versions/${version}/download/parquet"><button>Parquet</button></a>`:''}<a href="/api/datasets/${esc(datasetId)}/versions/${version}/download/quality"><button>${uiText('质量报告','Quality report')}</button></a><a href="/api/datasets/${esc(datasetId)}/versions/${version}/download/quarantine"><button>${uiText('隔离数据','Quarantine')}</button></a></div><details><summary>${uiText('字段结构','Schema')} (${Object.keys(m.schema||{}).length} ${uiText('列','columns')})</summary><div class="schema-grid">${Object.entries(m.schema||{}).map(([k,v])=>`<div><code>${esc(k)}</code><span>${esc(v.type)}${v.unit?' · '+esc(v.unit):''}</span></div>`).join('')}</div></details>`}catch(e){toast(e.message,'ERROR')}
}
$('#refreshDataFactory')?.addEventListener('click',loadDataFactory);
$('#buildDataset')?.addEventListener('click',async()=>{const status=$('#factoryBuildStatus');try{const qualities=[...$('#factoryQuality').selectedOptions].map(o=>o.value),taskIds=[...$('#factoryTasks').selectedOptions].map(o=>o.value);const partitions={development:Number($('#factorySplitDev').value||0),validation:Number($('#factorySplitVal').value||0),holdout:Number($('#factorySplitHold').value||0)};const total=Object.values(partitions).reduce((a,b)=>a+b,0);if(total<=0)throw new Error(uiText('开发集、验证集和留出集的分区权重之和必须大于0。','Partition weights must sum to a positive value.'));status.textContent=uiText('正在构建不可变数据集版本…','Building immutable dataset version…');const payload={dataset_id:$('#factoryDatasetExisting').value||null,project_id:state.activeProjectId||null,name:$('#factoryDatasetName').value.trim()||'motor-design-dataset',description:uiText('由 MotorCAD Studio 数据工厂构建','Built by MotorCAD Studio Data Factory'),task_ids:taskIds,quality_statuses:qualities,include_mock:false,deduplicate:$('#factoryDeduplicate').checked,constraints:[],partitions,seed:Number($('#factorySeed').value||42)};const result=await api('/api/datasets',{method:'POST',body:JSON.stringify(payload)});status.textContent=uiText(`已完成：${result.version_id} · ${result.row_count} 行 · 字段结构 ${String(result.schema_hash).slice(0,12)}`,`Ready: ${result.version_id} · ${result.row_count} rows · schema ${String(result.schema_hash).slice(0,12)}`);toast(uiText(`数据集 ${result.version_id} 已生成`,`Dataset ${result.version_id} ready`),'INFO');await loadDataFactory();await openDatasetVersion(result.dataset_id,result.version)}catch(e){status.textContent=e.message;toast(e.message,'ERROR')}});

function initTheme(){const saved=localStorage.getItem('motorcad-studio-theme');if(saved==='dark')document.body.classList.add('dark');$('#themeToggle')?.addEventListener('click',()=>{document.body.classList.toggle('dark');localStorage.setItem('motorcad-studio-theme',document.body.classList.contains('dark')?'dark':'light')})}
function initCommandPalette(){const palette=$('#commandPalette'),input=$('#commandSearch'),results=$('#commandResults');const commands=[['项目管理','projects'],['项目','dashboard'],['方案','solutions'],['电机配置','workspace'],['分析配置','analysisConfig'],['计算记录','tasks'],['实时求解','monitor'],['结果查看','resultViewer'],['数据资产（高级）','dataFactory'],['问题与日志','logs'],['运行环境','setup'],['系统诊断','system']];function close(){palette.classList.add('hidden')}function render(){const q=input.value.toLowerCase();const list=commands.filter(([name])=>name.toLowerCase().includes(q));results.innerHTML=list.map(([name,tab],i)=>`<div class="command-item ${i===0?'active':''}" data-command-tab="${tab}"><span>${name}</span><small>${tab}</small></div>`).join('');$$('[data-command-tab]').forEach(el=>el.addEventListener('click',()=>{showTab(el.dataset.commandTab);close()}))}document.addEventListener('keydown',e=>{if((e.ctrlKey||e.metaKey)&&e.key.toLowerCase()==='k'){e.preventDefault();palette.classList.remove('hidden');input.value='';render();queueMicrotask(()=>input.focus())}if(e.key==='Escape')close()});palette.addEventListener('click',e=>{if(e.target===palette)close()});input.addEventListener('input',render);input.addEventListener('keydown',e=>{if(e.key==='Enter'){const first=results.querySelector('[data-command-tab]');if(first){showTab(first.dataset.commandTab);close()}}});render()}
async function initV06(){initTheme();initCommandPalette();connectSystemStream();try{renderSystemSnapshot(await api('/api/system/metrics'))}catch{}await populateTaskSelectors()}
function updateTaskPreview(){
  const box=$('#taskPreview');if(!box||!state.selectedTemplate)return;let count=1;const mode=document.querySelector('input[name="experimentMode"]:checked')?.value||'single';if(mode==='sweep')count=Math.max(1,Number($('#sweepCount')?.value||1));else if(mode==='csv'){const text=$('#csvMatrix')?.value.trim()||'';count=text?Math.max(0,text.split(/\r?\n/).filter(x=>x.trim()).length-1):0}else if(mode==='full_factorial'){count=$$('.doe-row').reduce((n,row)=>n*Math.max(2,Number(row.querySelector('[data-doe-levels]')?.value||3)),1)+($('#doeIncludeBaseline')?.checked?1:0)}else if(['latin_hypercube','random','pareto_search'].includes(mode)){count=Math.max(2,Number($('#doeSamples')?.value||20))+($('#doeIncludeBaseline')?.checked?1:0)}else if(mode==='nsga2'){count=Math.max(4,Number($('#nsgaPopulation')?.value||16))*Math.max(1,Number($('#nsgaGenerations')?.value||4))+($('#doeIncludeBaseline')?.checked?1:0)}
  let changed=0;$$('[data-param]').forEach(input=>{const id=input.dataset.param,base=Number(state.selectedTemplate.defaults?.[id]),value=Number(input.value);const isChanged=Number.isFinite(base)&&Number.isFinite(value)&&Math.abs(base-value)>Math.max(1e-9,Math.abs(base)*1e-9);input.classList.toggle('parameter-changed',isChanged);if(isChanged)changed++});
  const expert=Object.values(state.expertOverrides||{}).reduce((n,x)=>n+Object.keys(x||{}).length,0);const solver=Object.values(state.solverSettings||{}).reduce((n,x)=>n+Object.keys(x||{}).length,0);box.textContent=`计算预览：${count} 个运行工况 · ${changed} 项电机参数调整 · ${expert+solver} 项高级设置`;updateParameterInspector();
}
queueMicrotask(updateTaskPreview);

function updateProjectNavState(){const hasProject=Boolean(state.activeProjectId);$$('[data-project-tab]').forEach(b=>{b.disabled=!hasProject;b.classList.toggle('project-nav-disabled',!hasProject);b.title=hasProject?'':uiText('请先从项目管理进入一个项目','Enter a project from Project Management first')})}
function activeProjectRecord(){return (state.workspaceProjects||[]).find(p=>p.id===state.activeProjectId)||(state.workspaceProject?.id===state.activeProjectId?state.workspaceProject:null)}
function setActiveProject(id){if(window.MCSEngineeringContext)window.MCSEngineeringContext.setProject(id||null,{source:'app:set-active-project'});else{state.activeProjectId=id||null;if(id)localStorage.setItem('motorcad-studio-active-project',id);else localStorage.removeItem('motorcad-studio-active-project')}updateProjectNavState();syncProjectContextSelectors();if($('#templateGrid'))renderTemplates();}
function syncProjectContextSelectors(){const p=activeProjectRecord();const badge=$('#activeProjectBadge');if(badge){badge.textContent=p?`${uiText('项目','Project')} · ${p.name}`:uiText('未进入项目','No active project');badge.classList.toggle('has-project',Boolean(p));badge.title=p?uiText('返回项目管理；项目切换仅在项目管理完成','Return to Project Management; switch projects there'):uiText('打开项目管理','Open Project Management')}const notice=$('#projectContextNotice');if(notice){notice.innerHTML=p?`<b>${uiText('当前项目','Current project')}：</b>${esc(p.name)} <small>${esc(p.id)}</small>`:`<b>${uiText('尚未进入项目','No active project')}</b> · ${uiText('请返回项目管理并进入一个项目。','Return to Project Management and enter a project.')}`;notice.classList.toggle('warning',!p)}const taskName=$('#taskProjectName');if(taskName)taskName.innerHTML=p?`${esc(p.name)} <small>${esc(p.id)}</small>`:uiText('未进入项目','No active project');const title=$('#currentProjectWorkspaceTitle');if(title)title.textContent=p?`${p.name} · ${uiText('项目工作区','Project Workspace')}`:uiText('项目工作区','Project Workspace');const meta=$('#currentProjectWorkspaceMeta');if(meta)meta.textContent=p?`${p.id} · ${uiText('本页只展示当前项目对象；项目切换请返回项目管理。','This page only shows the active project. Switch projects in Project Management.')}`:uiText('请先从项目管理进入项目。','Enter a project from Project Management first.')}
async function changeActiveProject(id){setActiveProject(id);state.workspaceProject=null;state.workspaceCreateTemplateId=null;state.workspaceCreateBusy=false;if(!window.MCSEngineeringContext){state.workspaceDesign=null;state.workspaceRevision=null;state.taskDesignRevisionId=null;state.selectedTask=null;state.monitorTask=null}if(!id){renderWorkspaceEmpty();return}if(state.routeOwnsLoadV025)return;await Promise.allSettled([loadDashboard(),loadTasks(),populateTaskSelectors(),loadDataFactory()]);if(document.querySelector('#workspace.tab.active'))await loadWorkspace();}
$('#activeProjectBadge')?.addEventListener('click',()=>showTab('projects'));

